From 97b476f042cc8f26d317624c273356cd6dcf855a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 05:13:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat (server+client): hold-Tab squad scoreboard overlay

Translucent overlay listing each operator's kills, downs, revives and total
cash earned. Stats are sent in the Spec Ops local-data block (bumps protocol
to 1028). Disabled in practice mode where Tab opens the practice menu.
